  "name": "Hard Boiled Eggs",
  "text": "Hard Boiled Eggs\n\nPreparation time: 0 minutes\n\nCooking time: 10 minutes with 10 minutes waiting\n\nYield:\n\nIngredients\n\neggs\n\nPreparation\n\n1. Put the eggs in a cold pan of water.\n\n2. Turn on the heat and bring to the boil.\n\n3. From when it starts cook for 7 1/2 minutes.\n\n4. Transfer to a bowl of cold water.",
